{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a thrilling world of treacherous dungeons, and endless combat! Knight of the Dungeon is a heart-pounding fusion of Rogue-Like and Bullet-Hell, with procedurally generated rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/extras/knight_of_the_dungeon_picture.png?t=1746728512\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Dungeons</strong> - Explore ever-changing levels filled with secrets, traps and treasures. No two playthroughs will be the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> - Fight hordes of monsters and mighty bosses while dodging spaces. Reflexes and strategy are your best allies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress and loot </strong>- in each location you will find new weapons and magical artifacts that will change your style of play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Small inventory size\u00a0</strong>- you only have three slots. Use them wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pleasant visual component</strong> - pleasant pixel graphics will accompany you throughout the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A World of Magic and Mystery</strong> - Discover ancient spells, interact with mysterious NPCs and uncover the history of this dangerous world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for challenges and adventures, your journey begins right now!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648620?t=1746728512","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648620?t=1746728512","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/bb74aeb5102550574ffd29355d3bcf656315b7ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746728512","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/bb74aeb5102550574ffd29355d3bcf656315b7ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746728512","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a thrilling world of treacherous dungeons, and endless combat! Knight of the Dungeon is a heart-pounding fusion of Rogue-Like and Bullet-Hell, with procedurally generated rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/extras/knight_of_the_dungeon_picture.png?t=1746728512\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Dungeons</strong> - Explore ever-changing levels filled with secrets, traps and treasures. No two playthroughs will be the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> - Fight hordes of monsters and mighty bosses while dodging spaces. Reflexes and strategy are your best allies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress and loot </strong>- in each location you will find new weapons and magical artifacts that will change your style of play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Small inventory size\u00a0</strong>- you only have three slots. Use them wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pleasant visual component</strong> - pleasant pixel graphics will accompany you throughout the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A World of Magic and Mystery</strong> - Discover ancient spells, interact with mysterious NPCs and uncover the history of this dangerous world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for challenges and adventures, your journey begins right now!</p>","developers":["LyrarmaStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/c8dac5d15b894ba74e4c96a5d63657e3e1d076e5/header.jpg?t=1746728512","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131827,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131827/movie480.mp4?t=1746458462","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131827/movie_max.mp4?t=1746458462"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131827/4ece42c4d90d4a03c2c57ce5a91cbfba5875d711/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746458462","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131827/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746458462","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131827/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746458462"}}],"name":"Knight of the Dungeon","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["LyrarmaStudio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age"